Acknowledgements
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

rustfs-gateway's conformance corpus draws on publicly reported S3 protocol behaviours,
including those documented in the issue history of the s3s project
(https://github.com/Nugine/s3s, Apache License 2.0).

rustfs-gateway is an independent implementation and is NOT a fork of s3s; it contains
no source code copied from s3s. Protocol behaviours learned from public
discussions are re-expressed as conformance cases written from scratch, and the
evidence recorded for each case is a URL plus an original one-line summary.

